SCOPE OF THE ABOVE

The MIT licence above covers only what the 1.6 port added:

  - the nine Wildness lines under statBases, which replace the wildness the
    original wrote in RaceProperties, and the Goliebbb label correction
  - Patches/AnimalProsthetics2.xml, written from scratch: it uses the names of
    A Dog Said... Animal Prosthetics 2's three category recipes and copies
    nothing from that mod
  - the French translation, and the About.xml text
  - About/Preview.png and About/ModIcon.png, both made for this port. The
    creatures the preview shows are Coolie's; the image is not
  - the tests (Tests/), the Pickle steps and features, the packaging and the
    documentation

IT DOES NOT COVER THE ORIGINAL MOD. The nine creatures, their defs, stats,
descriptions and textures are Coolie's work, reused here:

  https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2817264755

Coolie never declared a licence for them, so none is granted here and none
can be. They are redistributed under the usual practice for abandoned mods -
explicit credit, a link to the original, and removal on request.

If Coolie asks for this to be taken down, it comes down. Immediately, and
without discussion.

ATTRIBUTION.md records what was taken and what was changed.